WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.630
Meet Super Leia to the Rescue!

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.920
A coloring and activity book inspired

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:08.870
by a real dog named Leia.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.080
Color thirty pages of portraits,

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:11.960
seasons,

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:13.720
walks and holiday scenes.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.320
Then switch to mazes,

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:16.360
word searches,

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.040
crosswords and dot-to-dots,

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:19.640
with drawing prompts to dream up

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:20.560
her dog house,

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:21.640
her birthday cake,

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:23.000
or a game of fetch.

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:25.200
Counting and letter tracing hide inside

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:25.920
the fun,

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:27.080
and a full answer key at

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.760
the back means a grown-up is

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:29.750
never stuck.

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.400
Scan the QR code for a

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.920
free bonus color pack,

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:34.920
with reference images and real photos

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:35.800
of Leia.

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.400
A hundred and six pages for

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.600
ages four to eight,

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.870
from LogicManse Publications.
